status.description:
Account status. After the creation it is always `"new"`.

Values:
  * `new`—account is created, but not confirmed by email;
  * `active`—account is fully functioning (it is normally accomplished after email confirmation);
  * `disable`—account is disabled (the user cannot initiate account deactivation — it can only be done by the CRM operator).

sub_account_status.description:
The lifecycle status of the subaccount itself, not of its holder. After the creation it is always `"invited"`.

Values:
  * `invited`—the subaccount is created, the invitation has not been accepted yet;
  * `active`—the subaccount is active, the transition happens on its first sign-in;
  * `frozen`—the subaccount is frozen by the super account;
  * `frozen_invited`—the subaccount is frozen before the invitation was accepted.
